WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.315
<c.caption-en>Guide 6. Make and confirm an edit on the laptop.</c>
<c.caption-zh>指南 6：在电脑上修改并确认。</c>

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.775
<c.caption-en>Let's make our first change together.</c>
<c.caption-zh>我们一起来完成第一项修改。</c>

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:13.495
<c.caption-en>The starter has 30 cups, but our pretend class has 28 students.</c>
<c.caption-zh>起始表格写着 30 个杯子，但我们的模拟班级有 28 名学生。</c>

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.835
<c.caption-en>We're going to change the cups quantity to 28. First I'll find the row label Reusable cups</c>
<c.caption-zh>我们要把杯子数量改为 28。先找到 Reusable cups 这一行的标签，</c>

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:24.975
<c.caption-en>and find the Quantity column. The cell I need is B2. I'll select it and check the address box says B2.</c>
<c.caption-zh>再找到 Quantity 列。需要的单元格是 B2。选中它，检查地址框是否显示 B2。</c>

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:30.515
<c.caption-en>Now, with the cell selected, I'll type 28 to replace 30. Then I'll press</c>
<c.caption-zh>选中单元格后输入 28，替换原来的 30。然后按</c>

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:35.675
<c.caption-en>Enter to confirm my change. Now the selection might move to another cell.</c>
<c.caption-zh>Enter 确认修改。选中的位置现在可能会移到另一个单元格。</c>

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:41.545
<c.caption-en>I still need to look back at B2 and check its content. There it is: 28.</c>
<c.caption-zh>我仍然需要回头检查 B2 的内容。看，它显示 28。</c>

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:45.200
<c.caption-en>I've changed the quantity, not the label Reusable cups.</c>
<c.caption-zh>我改的是数量，不是 Reusable cups 这个文字标签。</c>

00:00:45.215 --> 00:00:52.135
<c.caption-en>Now you try. Change B2 to 28, confirm the edit and check the cell again.</c>
<c.caption-zh>现在你试一试。把 B2 改为 28，确认修改，再次检查单元格。</c>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:58.800
<c.caption-en>When you're sure B2 shows 28, return to the web page and select I checked B2. Continue. The next cards will guide your other changes.</c>
<c.caption-zh>确认 B2 显示 28 后，返回网页，选择 I checked B2. Continue。后面的卡片会引导其他修改。</c>
